{"3077540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Love: Fall in Death", "steam_appid": 3077540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An FMV interactive romantic comedy where your choices, timing, and luck shape every scene. Make decisions, roll the dice, and guide Kutay through a night that can turn into love or total chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What’s the dumbest thing three guys can do at a bar?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy. Pick one of them as the sacrificial lamb to hit on a girl!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, who’s the lucky &quot;sacrificial lamb&quot; tonight?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's you. Yeah, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/2ba3ef0296713da0aee268a77bce102c.poster.avif?t=1787449731\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/2ba3ef0296713da0aee268a77bce102c.webm?t=1787449731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/2ba3ef0296713da0aee268a77bce102c.mp4?t=1787449731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumped up by his friends, Kutay decides to make his move on Ayşil, one of the bar’s new regulars.  While Kutay’s approach is anything but innocent, you can bet Ayşil isn’t exactly innocent either!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/de49e5db60a1b047d196eac045c7e9dd.poster.avif?t=1787449731\" width=600 height=283 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/de49e5db60a1b047d196eac045c7e9dd.webm?t=1787449731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this FMV interactive romantic comedy game, their first encounter kicks off a night that can twist into flirtation, fear, or full-blown chaos, all depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, Kutay might discover things about himself, confront unexpected emotions, and realize that sometimes people are far more complicated than they seem. He could end up in a fight with strangers, caught between two powerful feelings, or screaming his head off. Sometimes he can’t take his eyes off someone; other times, he’s risking it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.poster.avif?t=1787449731\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.webm?t=1787449731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.mp4?t=1787449731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But isn’t that what love’s always like, in a way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/131c6248e86c26736ea3e924fa79fa40.poster.avif?t=1787449731\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/131c6248e86c26736ea3e924fa79fa40.webm?t=1787449731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/131c6248e86c26736ea3e924fa79fa40.mp4?t=1787449731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this wild ride of a night, Kutay’s got only one friend by his side: you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching, dynamic story progression driven by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 decisions that can dramatically change how scenes play out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dice mechanic that adds an element of luck and tension to key moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization options, allowing for multiple playthroughs and different approaches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4K resolution live-action visuals shot like a cinematic film.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time, directed action scenes with integrated Quick Time Events (QTEs) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story map you can track to see the paths you’ve taken.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice impacts the “love meter”, reflecting Kutay’s emotional journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.poster.avif?t=1787449731\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.webm?t=1787449731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.mp4?t=1787449731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help Kutay navigate the dangers of romance and fear to reach a happy ending, or will your choices lead him to a darker fate? Dive into &quot;Love: Fall in Death&quot; and explore a narrative where every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An FMV interactive romantic comedy where your choices, timing, and luck shape every scene. Make decisions, roll the dice, and guide Kutay through a night that can turn into love or total chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What’s the dumbest thing three guys can do at a bar?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy. Pick one of them as the sacrificial lamb to hit on a girl!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, who’s the lucky &quot;sacrificial lamb&quot; tonight?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's you. Yeah, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/2ba3ef0296713da0aee268a77bce102c.poster.avif?t=1787449731\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/2ba3ef0296713da0aee268a77bce102c.webm?t=1787449731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/2ba3ef0296713da0aee268a77bce102c.mp4?t=1787449731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumped up by his friends, Kutay decides to make his move on Ayşil, one of the bar’s new regulars.  While Kutay’s approach is anything but innocent, you can bet Ayşil isn’t exactly innocent either!</p><p clas